  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat oven to 425°F (220°C).",
    "2. Place sweet potatoes, carrots, and red onions on a baking sheet.",
    "3. Drizzle with lovely olive oil and sprinkle with salt and black pepper.",
    "4. Roast in the oven for 25-30 minutes, or until tender.",
